      <div class="feat-grid">
        <div class="feat-card">
          <h3>Window graphics</h3>
          <p>Cut-vinyl lettering, frosted privacy film, full-colour print and one-way vision for shop fronts, offices, clinics and restaurants. A-brand vinyl, bubble-free installation, removable without damage. From 149 euro per shop window including design and installation.</p>
          <a class="cta" href="/en/window-graphics-rotterdam/">Read about window graphics &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
          <h3>Vehicle wraps</h3>
          <p>Lettering, partial wraps and full vehicle wraps for cars, vans and light trucks. Your moving billboard, every day. We work with 3M and Avery cast vinyl that conforms to curved bodywork and removes cleanly after five to seven years. Free design mockup in 48 hours.</p>
          <a class="cta" href="/en/vehicle-wraps-rotterdam/">Read about vehicle wraps &rarr;</a>
        </div>
        <div class="feat-card">
