  <section class="section" aria-labelledby="why-title">
    <div class="container--narrow">
      <span class="eyebrow">What sets us apart</span>
      <h2 class="section-title" id="why-title">Why work with Alfa Reclame</h2>

      <p>Signage is a long-lived investment. A well-installed shop front survives five to seven years in the Dutch climate; a poorly installed one fades within a season. The difference is not the design but the material grade and the hands that apply it. Alfa Reclame works exclusively with cast vinyl from 3M, Avery Dennison, Hexis and Orafol, laminated against UV and abrasion. Installation is done by the owner, not subcontracted out.</p>

      <p>The second reason clients choose us is the absence of surprises. You receive a fixed-price quote up front, a free digital mockup within 48 hours, unlimited design revisions during the mockup stage, and no extra charges after delivery. For shops and hospitality venues that cannot close during business hours, we install on Saturdays or in the evening at no surcharge.</p>

      <p>We are based in Rotterdam Zuidoost and cover the entire Rotterdam region plus Schiedam, Vlaardingen, Capelle aan den IJssel, Barendrecht and Spijkenisse without travel costs. For port-side and industrial work we serve Botlek, Europoort and the Maasvlakte.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

